

1. High‑level concept

CMB Authored Physics Engine (CMB‑APE)

A blueprint‑driven simulation engine where the laws of physics are dynamically generated from:

a unified operator set

local state (fields, geometry, symmetries)

and your authorship vector C_MB

Core identity:

Authored: physics depends on you

Unified: multiple operators, one meta‑equation

Regime‑aware: different regions, different blends

Blueprint‑driven: everything declared, nothing hard‑wired

