So any result is cryptographically and structurally tied to you.

6. Minimal external API

From the outside, using your engine looks like:

from cmb_ape import CMBAuthoredPhysicsEngine

engine = CMBAuthoredPhysicsEngine("warp_field_blueprint.yaml")
engine.run()

Internally, that means:

Load blueprint

Load C_MB

Bind authorship into physics

Run authored unified equation

